<p> </p>
<p><strong>Early voting is available at the Sedgwick County Election Office during regular business hours, beginning Monday, October 19, 2026.  Early voting will end at Noon on Monday, November 2, 2026.</strong></p>
<p><strong> </strong></p>
<p><strong>Early voting is available Monday – Friday, from 8AM – 5PM, at the Advance Learning Library, 711 W 2<sup>nd</sup> St N, Wichita, and the Sedgwick County Extension Office, 7001 W 21<sup>st</sup> St N, Wichita, October 19 – 30, 2026.  These two locations will also be open from 9AM – 1PM on Saturday, October 31, 2026.</strong></p>
<p> </p>
